I will use the first mithril I am certain is not cursed, then switch
to the first studded leather I am certain is not cursed (keep pets
active until they take out the regular watchmen and there is often
a studded leather left by at least one), then switch to the first
dragon scale, then to my final GDSM/SDSM in the later game.

